      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-04-22",
      "text": "What changed: Organizations can now optionally customize the Employee Self‑Service agent landing page with branding and commonly used resources. If no customization is applied, there is no change to the existing experience, and the agent continues to use Copilot’s default appearance and starter prom",
